```

## 3. Document diagnostic (`textDocument/diagnostic`)

**`ruff_server`** — `/workspace/repo/crates/ruff_server/src/server/api/requests/diagnostic.rs`
- Struct `DocumentDiagnostic` → `req::DocumentDiagnosticRequest`, lines **10-14**; `run_with_snapshot` at **lines 18-39** returns a full report built from `generate_diagnostics(&snapshot)` (line 31).

**`ty_server`** — `/workspace/repo/crates/ty_server/src/server/api/requests/diagnostic.rs`
- Struct `DocumentDiagnosticRequestHandler` → `DocumentDiagnosticRequest`, lines **19-23**; `run_with_snapshot` at **lines 30-81** calls `compute_diagnostics(db, snapshot.document(), snapshot.encoding())` (line 42) and supports unchanged-report caching via `result_id`/`previous_result_id` (lines 50-78). Retriable with a server-cancelled error at lines 84-95.

