```

(Related: workspace/whole-project diagnostics live in `.../requests/workspace_diagnostic.rs` in ty_server.)

## 4. Tracking open documents

Both servers track open documents in an `Index` struct held by the `Session`, keyed by document URL/key to a document controller. Open/close mutate this map.

**`ruff_server`** — `/workspace/repo/crates/ruff_server/src/session/index.rs`
- `Index` struct at **lines 27-38**:

```rust
/// Stores and tracks all open documents in a session, along with their associated settings.
#[derive(Default)]
pub(crate) struct Index {
    /// Maps all document file URLs to the associated document controller
    documents: FxHashMap<Url, DocumentController>,
    /// Maps opaque cell URLs to a notebook URL (document)
    notebook_cells: FxHashMap<Url, Url>,
    /// Maps a workspace folder root to its settings.
    settings: WorkspaceSettingsIndex,
}
```
- Mutations: `open_text_document` (lines 300-303), `open_notebook_document` (lines 305-312), close/remove (~line 330), `open_documents_len` (line 393). The `Index` is owned by `Session` (`/workspace/repo/crates/ruff_server/src/session.rs`, field `index` at line 31; snapshots via `take_snapshot` at line 97).

**`ty_server`** — `/workspace/repo/crates/ty_server/src/session/index.rs`
- `Index` struct at **lines 11-16**:

```rust
/// Stores and tracks all open documents in a session, along with their associated settings.
#[derive(Debug)]
pub(crate) struct Index {
    /// Maps all document file paths to the associated document controller
    documents: FxHashMap<DocumentKey, Document>,
}
```
- Accessors/mutations: `text_documents` iterator (lines 25-32), `document_handle` (lines 34+), `open_text_document` (line 174), `open_notebook_document` (line 184). Notebook open/close cell handling around lines 78-117.

## Handler registration

Both servers dispatch requests through `.../server/api.rs` and re-export handlers in `.../server/api/requests.rs`. The `define_document_url!` macro (used e.g. in ruff diagnostic.rs line 17) generates the `document_url` mapping. No files were modified."}

